---
import {ranges,supportLinks} from '../data/storefront';
---
<section class="sales-assistance"><div class="wrap"><div><p class="eyebrow">NEED HELP CHOOSING A TRAILER?</p><h2>Let’s work out the right fit.</h2><p>Discuss the load, layout, equipment and collection arrangements for your next trailer.</p></div><div class="hero-buttons"><a class="button" href="/quote/">Get a quote →</a><a class="button outline" href="/locations/">Collection locations</a><a class="button outline" href="/contact/">Contact us</a></div></div></section>
<footer><div class="wrap footer-grid expanded"><div><a class="brand inverse" href="/"><span class="logo-crop"><img src="/brand/car-trailers-australia.png" width="2048" height="700" alt="Car Trailers Australia" loading="lazy"/></span></a><p>Explore trailer layouts for private, trade and commercial requirements.</p><p class="footer-company">Another B4L Pty Ltd Company</p><a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Sales & enquiries →</a></div><div><h3>Trailers</h3>{ranges.filter(r=>r.image).map(r=><a href={`/product-category/${r.slug}/`}>{r.name} <span>→</span></a>)}<a href="/shop/">View all trailers →</a></div><div><h3>Customer support</h3>{supportLinks.slice(0,8).map(([name,href])=><a href={href}>{name} <span>→</span></a>)}</div><div><h3>About Car Trailers</h3>{[['Our company','/about/'],['Locations','/locations/'],['Bulk trailer orders','/bulk-orders/'],['Become a dealer','/dealer/'],['News & guides','/news/'],['Compare trailers','/compare/']].map(([name,href])=><a href={href}>{name}<span>→</span></a>)}</div></div><div class="wrap trade-footer"><div><strong>A trailer for your working day.</strong><p>Explore our trade and gardening trailer designs.</p></div><a class="button" href="/gardening/">Explore trade & gardening →</a></div><div class="wrap footer-bottom"><span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} CAR TRAILERS AUSTRALIA</span><div><a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a><a href="/returns/">Returns</a><a href="/terms/">Terms</a><a href="/sitemap/">Sitemap</a></div></div></footer>
<details class="help-widget"><summary>Need help? <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></summary><div><h3>How can we help?</h3><a href="/quote/">Choose a trailer →</a><a href="/delivery/">Collection & delivery →</a><a href="/finance/">Finance information →</a><a href="/maintenance/">Maintenance & service →</a><a href="/contact/">Contact the team →</a></div></details>
